# ── AI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, the backend uses the Anthropic SDK with ephemeral prompt
# caching for chat and AI insights. When unset, falls back to the local
# Claude CLI binary if installed.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── Solana ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Path to the keypair used for ZK proof anchoring (memo transactions).
# Defaults to ~/.config/solana/id.json.
# SOLANA_KEYPAIR_PATH=/path/to/id.json

# Path to the marketplace treasury keypair. Different from SOLANA_KEYPAIR_PATH
# so the buyer's payment lands in a wallet distinct from the data owner's.
# See README.md "On-chain features" for one-time setup.
# TREASURY_KEYPAIR_PATH=/path/to/treasury.json

# ── Wearables (optional fallback) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Wearable credentials are paste-able from the /wearable page UI and stored
# in the local SQLite settings table. The env vars below are checked only
# when the UI-saved credentials are absent — useful for headless deployments.
#
# Each provider needs a developer app created at the provider's portal with
# the matching callback URL registered:
#   Fitbit  http://localhost:8000/api/wearable/fitbit/callback
#   WHOOP   http://localhost:8000/api/wearable/whoop/callback
#   Oura    http://localhost:8000/api/wearable/oura/callback
#
# FITBIT_CLIENT_ID=
# FITBIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_ID=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OURA_CLIENT_ID=
# OURA_CLIENT_SECRET=
